  "description": "Comment \"CLIPS\" and I'll send you the link\n\nSubmagic's Magic Clips takes one long video and turns it into twenty ready-to-post shorts.\n\nYou upload something long, like a podcast or an interview, and it finds the best moments on its own.\n\nEvery clip comes out finished, with the captions already on it.\n\nIt even scores each clip on how likely it is to go viral, and writes the hook title for you.\n\nOne upload, and you've got a month of content ready to post.",
